<h2 class="bold" id="adding-new-pictograms"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="pictogram#adding-new-pictograms">Adding New Pictograms</a></h2>
<p>When adding pictograms, ensure you include both theme versions:</p>
<ol>
<li>Create the light version with your pictogram name (e.g., <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">pictogram-name</span></span></code></span>)</li>
<li>Create the dark version with the <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">--dark</span></span></code></span> suffix (e.g., <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">pictogram-name--dark</span></span></code></span>)</li>
<li>Add both files to <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">src/assets/icons</span></span></code></span> folder</li>
<li>They will be built into the sprite automatically</li>
</ol>
<p>The Pictogram component will automatically select the appropriate version based on the current theme.</p>
